    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Acceptance... is that supposed to be enough? To just sit here and rot in this guilt? There was a time when a commander's final duty was to his men, to his honor. A man who cannot face the light of day shouldn't have to keep pretending. I look at my blade and I wonder if there is any way to truly settle this debt, to find a way to make everything quiet and finally be done with the shame.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
